<DIV CLASS="title2">Products</DIV>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
Finding products to add to a Contract or Payable begin with searching via either the Drop Down Menus, Search Strings, or a combination of both.  To use the Drop Down Menu, click on the arrow for whichever category you want to search under.  The categories include 4 levels from your product database.  After you click on the arrow (to the right of each category), use your mouse to make a selection.  You can also make selections in multiple areas (type a string in the search box, and select as many of the levels as you wish).  After making your selections from the Drop Down Menu(s) click on the “Search” button to the right of the Search String window.  You will receive a list of products that you can either individually select or click the box in the upper left hand corner of your Search Results (orange bar) to check all.  
</BLOCKQUOTE>

